FloorWitness: the program's first kernel-checked IMPOSSIBILITY artifact —
"no entrywise-ball positivity certificate of the house form with δ ≥ 1e−20
exists at the (L, m) = (711/200, 40) window."

Main results:
  `floor_witness`         — the 1e−20 ball around the explicit rational
                            midpoint matrix mRat (= aFun/10^25, unnormalized
                            Legendre basis P_0..P_39, truncated Weil form of
                            zeta at support L = 711/200) contains a SYMMETRIC
                            rational matrix with a strictly negative direction.
  `no_ball_certificate_ge`— hence the conclusion of the house window theorems
                            (`Weilcert.weil_window_positive` shape / the
                            `CertFramework.cert_window_positive` conclusion) is
                            FALSE at this window for every radius δ' ≥ 1e−20.
  `depth_law_bracket`     — formal regression of the depth law (SYNTHESIS Q5):
                            the ℓ¹-normalized Rayleigh value of the witness is
                            kernel-checked into (1.5e−21, 1.6e−21) — the
                            measured certificate floor δ* at this window in the
                            house (unnormalized-basis) ball form.
  `headroom_sixfold`      — the witness clears δ = 1e−20 with 6× headroom.

Adversary (PT R2.2 C-9 dispatch spec; CS-1(v)): M = A − δ·s·sᵀ with
s = sign(x), reducing everything to ONE exact-ℤ inequality
  x ⬝ᵥ A.mulVec x < δ·(Σᵢ|xᵢ|)²  ⟺  qWit < 10^5 · sWit²,
kernel-checked below as the two-sided bracket `key_bracket`.

Data provenance: A = round(10^25 · midpoints) of the 220-bit outward-rounded
interval enclosures of src/certified_spectral.py at (L, m) = (711/200, 40)
(exact identification budget 4.989e−26); x = the bottom eigenvector of the
midpoint matrix (dps-60 eigsy), truncated to denominator 10^15 (spectral gap
λ₂/λ₁ ≈ 300 in this frame; truncation moves the Rayleigh value only in the
7th digit). Every identity below was re-verified exactly in Fraction/int
arithmetic before emission, and the standing certificate-coherence oracle
(midpoints vs enclosures; eigenvalue vs the certified enclosure
[1.7997e−20, 1.79972291e−20]; cross-implementation vs spectral_form at exact
decimal L) PASSED — see results/agent-floor-witness.md.

Interpretation rides the usual computer-assisted Bridge (THEOREMS.md): mRat
is entrywise within 4.989e−26 of the true truncated Weil matrix at this
window. The kernel-checked statements themselves are exact facts about mRat;
no floating point, no native_decide, no axioms beyond propext,
Classical.choice, Quot.sound.
-/
